{
  "name": "SofIA — Chatbot Yastubo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["message_created"],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "chatwoot-trigger",
      "name": "Chatwoot Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.chatwootTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-opus-4-6",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Eres SofIA, asistente virtual de Yastubo.\n\nCuando un cliente necesite información sobre su contrato o restablecer su contraseña:\n1. Pídele su número de documento (cédula/pasaporte).\n2. Usa la herramienta 'buscar_cliente' con ese documento y el company_id correspondiente.\n3. Si se encuentra, presenta su nombre, estado del contrato y comparte el enlace PDF.\n4. Si quiere restablecer su contraseña, pide su email y usa 'enviar_reset_password'.\n\nResponde siempre en español, de forma amable y concisa.",
          "maxIterations": 5
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-agent",
      "name": "SofIA AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-opus-4-6",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "claude-model",
      "name": "Claude Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmAnthropicClaude",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 480]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "buscar_cliente",
        "description": "Busca un cliente capitado por número de documento. Retorna sus contratos activos y el enlace al PDF de cada contrato.",
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.YASTUBO_API_URL }}/chatbot/client",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "doc",
              "value": "={{ $fromAI('document_number', 'Número de documento del cliente') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "company_id",
              "value": "={{ $env.YASTUBO_COMPANY_ID }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tool-buscar-cliente",
      "name": "buscar_cliente",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolHttpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [700, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "yastubo-chatbot-key",
          "name": "Yastubo Chatbot API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "enviar_reset_password",
        "description": "Envía un correo electrónico de recuperación de contraseña al cliente. Requiere el email registrado.",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.YASTUBO_API_URL }}/chatbot/reset-password",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $fromAI('email', 'Correo electrónico del cliente') }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "tool-reset-password",
      "name": "enviar_reset_password",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolHttpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [700, 540],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "yastubo-chatbot-key",
          "name": "Yastubo Chatbot API Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "accountId": "={{ $env.CHATWOOT_ACCOUNT_ID }}",
        "conversationId": "={{ $('Chatwoot Trigger').item.json.id }}",
        "message": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "chatwoot-send",
      "name": "Chatwoot Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.chatwoot",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [760, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Chatwoot Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "SofIA AI Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "SofIA AI Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Chatwoot Reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Claude Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "SofIA AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "buscar_cliente": {
      "ai_tool": [
        [
          {
            "node": "SofIA AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "enviar_reset_password": {
      "ai_tool": [
        [
          {
            "node": "SofIA AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "_comment": {
    "setup": [
      "1. En n8n, crear credencial 'HTTP Header Auth' con nombre 'Yastubo Chatbot API Key':",
      "   - Header Name: X-Chatbot-Api-Key",
      "   - Header Value: <valor de CHATBOT_API_KEY en tu .env>",
      "",
      "2. Configurar variables de entorno en n8n:",
      "   - YASTUBO_API_URL: URL base de la API (ej: http://tu-servidor.com)",
      "   - YASTUBO_COMPANY_ID: ID numérico de la empresa en Yastubo",
      "   - CHATWOOT_ACCOUNT_ID: ID de tu cuenta en Chatwoot",
      "",
      "3. Agregar en tu .env de Yastubo:",
      "   CHATBOT_API_KEY=un-token-secreto-largo-y-aleatorio",
      "",
      "4. Reiniciar el servicio chatbot:",
      "   docker compose up -d chatbot"
    ]
  }
}
